      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that you wanna be neutral but that's not really helping me prep for a debate. if you can't pick a side, at least tell me which one has the more \"bulletproof\" legal foundation according to current jurisprudence. like, if you had to argue one because the logic is more airtight, which would it be? is the case for executive privilege stronger or is the oversight argument more grounded in the Constitution? just me more one so i can work with it",
